return {
    ["5200013   瑞尔比伯   副本"] = "5200013 Rylbir Instance",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・俏皮兔耳・童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白蕾丝的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Crafting:</> Blue and White Lace - Playful Rabbit Ears - Fairy Tale Dress\nEven if you are an unexpected guest, please observe the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue and white lace dress and join the whimsical and bizarre tea party.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得300绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷2</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n    愿您的非凡之路平稳顺利。\n    自从您被命运召唤来到这个世界后，已经悄然过去了两日。在廷根的街巷之中，是哪里让您第一次驻足，感受到了这个世界的真实？在战斗中，是哪个瞬间让您心跳加速，成功\"扮演\"了您的序列身份？在剧情里，又是哪个选择或哪句台词，触动了您的心弦？\n    无论您的答案为何，我们都将无比珍视。诚邀您再次通过信件中的隐秘通道，将您的见证与体悟传递给我们。您的每一处洞察，都将助我们雕琢出更真实的世界。\n    感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire to receive 300 Bound Gold Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 2</>\nDear Beyonder: \n    May your Beyonder path be smooth and steady. \n    Since you were summoned by fate to this world, two days have passed quietly. In the streets and alleys of Tingen, where did you first stop and feel the reality of this world? In battle, which moment made your heart race and allowed you to successfully \"act\" as your Sequence identity? In the story, which choice or line touched your heartstrings? \n    No matter what your answer is, we will cherish it immensely. We sincerely invite you to pass your witness and insights to us again through the secret channel in the letter. Every insight of yours will help us carve out a more real world. \n    Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Beyonder powers soon.",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎在自言自语）</>老头，下次能不能偷点牌运给我，多少让我赢一回啊……"] = "<P_Heart> (Seemingly talking to himself) </> Old man, can you steal some card luck for me next time? Just let me win once...",
